# Donni Anthania, the crazy cat lady, north of Goldshire.
# Sources: items.json / npcs.json (vendor, stock); Forever's client data
# 1.60.1.70532 (ItemSparse prices: 40s each; every pet item teaches its
# companion when used).

step Donni Anthania
  tip Donni Anthania has a farmhouse north of Goldshire. Each cat carrier costs 40s, 1g 60s for all four. Each pet item teaches its companion when you use it; the goals stay ticked afterwards.
  vendor 6367                         -- Donni Anthania
  buy 8485 npc 6367 optional          -- Cat Carrier (Bombay), 40s
  buy 8486 npc 6367 optional          -- Cat Carrier (Cornish Rex), 40s
  buy 8487 npc 6367 optional          -- Cat Carrier (Orange Tabby), 40s
  buy 8488 npc 6367 optional          -- Cat Carrier (Silver Tabby), 40s
